Posted: N53 23.030 W117 36.758&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hole was obvious. About 6 inches in front of the flagged wood lath and 4 inches below ground level. Dusted off some dirt and wiped the cap for its picture. Thanks for another one. &lt;/p&gt;

