          <groundspeak:finder id="381001">Foster Bros</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP483 - Hinton Golf Club&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For the amount of time I've spent in Hinton, I haven't found many of the caps here. I started at the west end of town this afternoon and picked this one off, then a bunch of other caches. The rain had driven most of the golfers away so it was quiet while I snapped the pictures. Thanks for another cap!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Older Foster Bro&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
